  "post_content": "<p>A las 20 horas de anoche s&aacute;bado, los clavarios encendieron la hogera de San Antonio en Tales. Desde ese momento comenzaron a cabalgar los caballos por todas las calles del pueblo y a acercarse a la hoguera.</p>\n<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2012/01/IMG_7826.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px\" /></p>\n<p>M&aacute;s de noche todav&iacute;a, a las 21.30 horas, se celebr&oacute; la &quot;matx&agrave;&quot; oficial y se repartieron los rollos, dulces como en Veo.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7817.jpg\" alt=\"img_7817\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7818.jpg\" alt=\"img_7818\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7820.jpg\" alt=\"img_7820\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7821.jpg\" alt=\"img_7821\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7822.jpg\" alt=\"img_7822\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7823.jpg\" alt=\"img_7823\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7824.jpg\" alt=\"img_7824\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7825.jpg\" alt=\"img_7825\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7826.jpg\" alt=\"img_7826\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7827.jpg\" alt=\"img_7827\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7828.jpg\" alt=\"img_7828\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7829.jpg\" alt=\"img_7829\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7830.jpg\" alt=\"img_7830\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7831.jpg\" alt=\"img_7831\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7832.jpg\" alt=\"img_7832\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7833.jpg\" alt=\"img_7833\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7834.jpg\" alt=\"img_7834\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7835.jpg\" alt=\"img_7835\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/sanantonitales/img_7836.jpg\" alt=\"img_7836\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
